  dialogues:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7196704bcae5bf4d95027176e47e152, type: 2}
    dialogue: so you know that pistol you have, right?
    hasChoices: 0
    dialogueChoices: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7196704bcae5bf4d95027176e47e152, type: 2}
    dialogue: if you have at least one chip, you can press <ITEM_SPECIAL> while holding
      the gun to launch a chip
    hasChoices: 0
    dialogueChoices: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7196704bcae5bf4d95027176e47e152, type: 2}
    dialogue: if you shoot it before it lands, you get to hit two targets at the
      same time!
    hasChoices: 0
    dialogueChoices: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7196704bcae5bf4d95027176e47e152, type: 2}
    dialogue: you can also shoot it even after it hits the ground, but then it'll
      only hit one target.
    hasChoices: 0
    dialogueChoices: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7196704bcae5bf4d95027176e47e152, type: 2}
    dialogue: you'll receive a chip for each target you hit with one as well.
    hasChoices: 0
    dialogueChoices: []
